    "text_full": "Email Us\nChat Now\nTickets, City Sightseeing Pass, Transportation, Bus Tours\nTravel Blog\nALL\nNEW YORK\nLAS VEGAS\nLOS ANGELES\nANTELOPE CANYON\nALL\nNEW YORK\nLAS VEGAS\nLOS ANGELES\nANTELOPE CANYON\nTours\n\ntours, tickets, activities from Los Angeles\n\nHOME\nEXPERIENCES\nLOS ANGELES\n26 found\nBest Seller\nPrice ↑\nPrice ↓\nDuration ↑\nDuration ↓\nBest Seller\nUniversal Studios Hollywood 1-Day General Admission\n\nConveniently and quickly purchase your own one-day ticket to Universal Studios Hollywood. Experience exciting rides, a real movie studio tour, and the best restaurants in Los Angeles. The whole family will be very happy.\n\n LA-T-12505\n < 1 Day\n Los Angeles\n$109\n5% OFF\nWhale-Watching Cruise from Newport Beach\n\n2.5-hour cruise to see California whales & dolphins with naturalist commentary and scenic coastline views.\n\n LA-12697\n < 1 Day\n Los Angeles\n$36 $34.2\n5% OFF\nAquarium of the Pacific Admission Ticket (Adult)\n\nSkip the ticket line with e-voucher and discover Southern California, Northern and Tropical Pacific habitats.\n\n LA-12716\n < 1 Day\n Los Angeles\n$44.95 $42.7\nUniversal Studios Hollywood Express (1-Day Admission + One-Time Express)\n\nUniversal Studios Hollywood Express, Includes ONE-TIME (per day) express access to each ride, attraction, and seated show. Express access is a separate line with a shorter wait time.\n\n LA-T-12506\n < 1 Day\n Los Angeles\n$264\nDolby Theatre Ticket and Tour\n\nVisit the Oscar venue, enjoy a 30-min guided English tour, with full accessibility.\n\n LA-12718\n < 1 Day\n Los Angeles\n$28.83\nHollywood & Beverly Hills Bus Tour\n\n2-hour open-air bus tour of Hollywood landmarks and celebrity homes.\n\n LA-12696\n 1 Day\n Los Angeles\n$39\n1% OFF\nGriffith Observatory Insider Tour\n\nOur small-group tour, crafted by observatory insiders, takes you on a curated journey through space and time, blending science, history, architecture, and movie trivia. You'll get the perspective of a local pro who knows the observatory's secrets firsthand.\n\n LA-12702\n 1 Day\n Los Angeles\n$56 $55.44\n25% OFF\nLos Angeles City 1-Day Tour (Daily Departure)\n\nExplore highlighted locations in Los Angeles!\n\n LA1-2078\n 1 Day\n Los Angeles\n$115 $86.25\n1% OFF\nJoshua Tree National Park + Richard Nixon Presidential Library and Museum 1-day Tour\n\nJoshua Tree National Park, rare plants, so you can easily get out of the film in a second!\n\n LA1-7151\n 1 Day\n Los Angeles\n$170 $168.3\nMadame Tussauds Hollywood Admission + Marvel 4D + Robot Riot 7D\n\nMeet famous figures from the past and present\n\n LA-T-12088\n < 1 Day\n Los Angeles\n$36.99\nGo City - Los Angeles Explorer Pass - Choose 2, 3, 4, 5, or 7 attractions\n\nSave more on the best Los Angeles attractions\n\n LA-T-11407\n < 1 Day\n Los Angeles\n$97.6\nAmtrak Coast Starlight+ Santa Barbara 1-Day Tour\n\nRide on a train to Santa Barbara!\n\n LA1-5737\n 1 Day\n Los Angeles\n$170\nGo City: Los Angeles All-Inclusive Pass Plus (Includes 40+ Popular Attractions)\n\nDiscover 40+ top Los Angeles attractions and save up to 45% with Go City. Choose a 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 or 7 day All Inclusive Pass and cosy up with your favorite celebrity at Madame Tussauds, enjoy unlimited rides at Knott's Berry Farm, hike up to the Hollywood sign and more!\n\n LA-T-453\n < 1 Day\n Los Angeles\n$232.4\nUniversal Studios Hollywood VIP Experience (1-Day Admission + Unlimited Express Pass + VIP service)\n\nEnjoy VIP privileges at Universal Studios Hollywood, with unlimited express access to ALL rides and attractions. Today, you’re the star.\n\n LA-T-12507\n < 1 Day\n Los Angeles\n$353.13\n2% OFF\nSold Out\nLos Angeles: 3-Hr Hollywood Sign Hike Walking Tour\n\nVoted top Hollywood hike in LA, closest view of the Hollywood Sign, guided in English.\n\n LA-12726\n < 1 Day\n Los Angeles\n$29.08 $28.5\n1\n2\n \nClear Filters\nCategories\n\nAll\n\nTicket & Activity\n\nDay Tour\n\nMulti-day Package\n\nStart City\n\nLas Vegas\n\nNew York\n\nPage\n\